Cursor SDK integration

T3 Code uses the unmodified @cursor/sdk 1.5.0 package published by Anysphere.
The SDK and any platform packages it includes retain their upstream notices and
terms. T3 Code's MIT license does not apply to those third-party components.

SDK documentation: https://cursor.com/docs/sdk/typescript
Applicable terms: https://cursor.com/terms-of-service

This notice describes the integration and grants no additional modification or
redistribution rights. Release packaging must preserve the upstream package
notices and satisfy their applicable terms. The previous T3-specific SDK patch
is not applied or included in new source packages.
